rdt"] " qualified for the final first time round but could only finish fifth in the rerun which was won by " [:a {:href "/athletes/77147"} "Tatyana Anisimova"] ". Seventy five minutes later Ansimova was back on track for the final and only missed out on gold to " [:a {:href ""} "Johanna Schaller"] " by a hundredth of a second. It is interesting to speculate what the result would have been if Anisimova did not have that extra race in her legs.  The final was very close with the first four runners finishing within 0.05 seconds."] "\n"] [:table {:class "table table-striped"} [:thead {} [:tr {} [:th {} "Pos"] [:th {} "Number"] [:th {} "Competitor"] [:th {} "NOC"] [:th {} "R1"] [:th {} "SF"] [:th {} "Final"] [:th {}] [:th {}] [:th {}]]] [:tbody {} [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "1"] [:td {:class "bib"} "156"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/69727"} "Johanna Schaller"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/GDR"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/GDR.png"}] "GDR"]] [:td {} "13.02 (2 h3)"] [:td {} "12.93 (1 h1)"] [:td {} "12.77 (1)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Gold"} "Gold"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "2"] [:td {:class "bib"} "328"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/77147"} "Tatyana Anisimova"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/URS"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/URS.png"}] "URS"]] [:td {} "12.98 (1 h1)"] [:td {} "12.91 (1 h2)"] [:td {} "12.78 (2)"] [:td {} [:span {:class "Silver"} "Silver"]] [:td {}] [:td {}]] [:tr {:class "", :style ""} [:td {} "3"] [:td {:class "bib"} "344"] [:td {} [:a {:href "/athletes/77247"} "Nataliya Lebedeva"]] [:td {} [:a {:href "/countries/URS"} [:img {:style "padding-right: 2px; vertical-align: middle", :src "https://olympedia-flags.s3.eu-central-1.amazonaws.com/URS.png"}] "URS"]] [:td {} "12.94 (1 h3)"] [:td {} "13.03 (3 h1)"] [:td {} "12.80 (3)"] [:td {}